                <pb facs="1271" n="1121" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg1121"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Leishman
                        to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Pera</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1907-04-14"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">April 14, 1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Leishman states that the minister for foreign affairs sent word informally
                    yesterday that the sublime porte has adhered to the Russian proposition
                    regarding the attendance of the nonsignatory powers to the next Hague
                    Conference.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
